  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Xiphactinus audax-inspired short, deep-headed fish reconstruction in an unsupported swimming pose. Cranial and body proportions are reference-informed; soft tissue, colour and life pose are artistic, not an exact specimen restoration.",
    "zh": "剑射鱼 Xiphactinus audax 启发的短深头鱼类复原，采用无支架游泳姿态。颅骨与身体比例由参考启发，软组织、颜色和生活姿态为艺术解释，并非精确标本修复。"
  },
